          "items": [
            "Microservices bring agility, scalability, and independent deployability.",
            "However, they also bring complexity in communication, testing, deployment, and security.",
            "Use proper design patterns, tooling, and automation to handle complexity.",
            "Stick to DDD, CI/CD, API Gateway, containerization, and distributed tracing for scalable microservice systems."
